<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to firm. Demand was moderate. Top $47.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 46.00-47.00, liberal volume 46.50-47.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-43.00, few 38.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs. 46.00-47.00</p>
</text>
